@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About — Vinyl Vault</PageTitle>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; background: #fafafa; border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="is-flex is-justify-content-space-between is-align-items-center is-flex-wrap-wrap" style="gap: 1.5rem;">
            <div>
                <h1 class="title is-2" style="font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #111;">
                    Vinyl Vault
                </h1>

                <p class="subtitle is-5" style="color: #666; font-weight: 400; max-width: 650px;">
                    A full-stack record shop inventory app built with Blazor, ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework Core, and SQL Server.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="field is-grouped is-grouped-multiline">
                <div class="control">
                    <span class="tag" style="background: #111; color: #fff; font-family: monospace; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 4px;">Portfolio Project</span>
                </div>

                <div class="control">
                    <span class="tag" style="background: #eaeaea; color: #444; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 4px;">Blazor</span>
                </div>

                <div class="control">
                    <span class="tag" style="background: #eaeaea; color: #444; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 4px;">ASP.NET Core</span>
                </div>

                <div class="control">
                    <span class="tag" style="background: #eaeaea; color: #444; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 4px;">SQL Server</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<div class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">

    <div class="columns" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <div class="column is-4">
            <h2 class="title is-5" style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888;">
                System Overview
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-8">
            <p class="content is-size-5" style="color: #333; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300;">
                Vinyl Vault demonstrates a full-stack .NET workflow: a component-based Blazor frontend communicates with an ASP.NET Core Web API over HTTP/JSON, while Entity Framework Core manages SQL Server persistence. The system supports catalogue browsing, album detail views, stock visibility, and CRUD operations for record inventory.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="background-color: #eaeaea; height: 1px; margin: 2.5rem 0;" />

    <div class="columns" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <div class="column is-4">
            <h2 class="title is-5" style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888;">
                Architecture Stack
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="column is-8">
            <div class="columns">
                <div class="column is-6">
                    <div style="border-top: 2px solid #111; padding-top: 1.25rem; height: 100%;">
                        <h3 class="subtitle is-5" style="font-weight: 700; color: #111; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                            Frontend
                        </h3>

                        <ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #555; line-height: 1.8;">
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Blazor Components:</strong> Reusable components for record lists, summary cards, detail forms, and add-record workflows.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Routing:</strong> Route-based pages for home, all records, individual record details, and adding new records.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">REST Integration:</strong> Uses HttpClient to load, create, update, and delete records through the backend API.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Responsive UI:</strong> Styled with Bulma CSS for clean layouts across list, form, and detail pages.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="column is-6">
                    <div style="border-top: 2px solid #eaeaea; padding-top: 1.25rem; height: 100%;">
                        <h3 class="subtitle is-5" style="font-weight: 700; color: #111; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                            Backend
                        </h3>

                        <ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #555; line-height: 1.8;">
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">ASP.NET Core API:</strong> Exposes endpoints for browsing, searching, creating, updating, and deleting album records.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Entity Framework Core:</strong> Uses EF Core with SQL Server for album persistence and database migrations.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Layered Architecture:</strong> Separates controller, service, and repository responsibilities using dependency injection.
                            </li>

                            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                <strong style="color:#111;">Testing:</strong> Includes NUnit and Moq tests across controller, service, and repository layers.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="background-color: #eaeaea; height: 1px; margin: 2.5rem 0;" />

    <div class="columns" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <div class="column is-4">
            <h2 class="title is-5" style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888;">
                Data Flow
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="column is-8">
            <div style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 6px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #333; overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Blazor UI ──[HTTP / JSON]──> API Controllers ──> Services ──> Repositories ──> SQL Server
            </div>

            <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
                User actions in the Blazor frontend trigger asynchronous HTTP requests to the ASP.NET Core API.
                Controllers handle routing and validation, services coordinate application logic, and repositories use
                Entity Framework Core to read and write album data in SQL Server.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="background-color: #eaeaea; height: 1px; margin: 2.5rem 0;" />

    <div class="columns">
        <div class="column is-4">
            <h2 class="title is-5" style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888;">
                Development Roadmap
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-8">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: #fff8e1; color: #b78103; border: 1px solid #ffe082; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;">Phase 2</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong style="color: #111; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Authentication & Role-Based Access</strong>
                        <p style="color: #555; margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            Add login functionality and restrict add, update, and delete actions to authorised staff users.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: #f0f4f8; color: #1e4e8c; border: 1px solid #d0e2f5; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;">Phase 3</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong style="color: #111; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">AI Catalogue Assistant</strong>
                        <p style="color: #555; margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            Add a natural language assistant for searching the catalogue, recommending records, and answering stock-related questions.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: #f4f4f4; color: #666; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;">Backlog</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong style="color: #111; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Image Uploads & Storage</strong>
                        <p style="color: #555; margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            Replace image URL input with album cover uploads and store artwork using backend or cloud storage.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
